{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13206270","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13206270","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1320627001:0":{"text":"反応はないか……これだけでは足りないということか。","source_cn":"……还是没有反应。光凭这些手写书信仍然不够。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5B76ACACDA8EBAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320627002:1":{"text":"お兄様の魂を呼び覚ませるような大切な物とは、一体何なのでしょうか……","source_cn":"对于哥哥来说，能唤起他灵魂的珍贵东西到底是什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB75CA9CA05D3B70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320627003:1":{"text":"カレリーナさん、お兄さんは他に何か大事な物を残していないのですか？","source_cn":"卡列琳娜小姐，铐兰生前没有再留下其他重要的东西了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E7451F8A78E6ABA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320627004:1":{"text":"ないと思います……機械になった兄と一緒に、荘園の中を何度も歩き回りましたが、当時の居室はもう影も形も残っていません……","source_cn":"没有了，他变成机械人偶后一直陪着我，我们在下雪的庄园遗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04DF2DB240042CE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320627005:1":{"text":"兄の過去や、私の子ども時代の思い出、共に過ごしたすべてが消えてしまいました……","source_cn":"他的过去，我的童年，我们共同经历过的一切……都已经不复存在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98F3FDC441D40994","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1320627005":{"text":"兄の過去や、私の子ども時代の思い出、共に過ごしたすべてが消えてしまいました……","source_cn":"他的过去，我的童年，我们共同经历过的一切……都已经不复存在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98F3FDC441D40994","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320627006:1":{"text":"君は、カレリーナ自身をゴーランの魂の媒介にするというのか？彼女は物ではなく、魂を宿した存在なのだぞ。","source_cn":"你想让卡列琳娜亲自当牵引铐兰灵魂的媒介？她不是一件物品...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBA1BF0C7FAA24116","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"君は、カレリーナ自身をゴーランの魂の媒介にするというのか？彼女は物ではなく、魂を宿した存在なのだぞ。","female":"君は、カレリーナ自身をゴーランの魂の媒介にするというのか？彼女は物ではなく、魂を宿した存在なのだぞ。","variant_male_record_index":"145938","variant_female_record_index":"145939","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320627007:1":{"text":"魂を引き寄せる魔法は非常に危険だ。わずかな間違いでも、二人の魂に取り返しのつかない損害を与えかねない。","source_cn":"牵引灵魂的魔法极其危险，操作不当会对铐兰和卡列琳娜的灵...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA7D667D60D8AA86A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"魂を引き寄せる魔法は非常に危険だ。わずかな間違いでも、二人の魂に取り返しのつかない損害を与えかねない。","female":"魂を引き寄せる魔法は非常に危険だ。わずかな間違いでも、二人の魂に取り返しのつかない損害を与えかねない。","variant_male_record_index":"145940","variant_female_record_index":"145941","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320627008:1":{"text":"つまり、不可能ではないのですね？","source_cn":"所以，是可行的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21CC6BACF1901EF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320627009:1":{"text":"試したことはないし、誰かに試そうとも思わないな。","source_cn":"我没有试过，而且不想在任何人身上尝试。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0531D7F3E09D4BC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320627010:1":{"text":"……私は大丈夫です、子爵様。","source_cn":"……子爵先生，请听我说。我不介意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCCDAE0E4567D2E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320627011:1":{"text":"むしろ、ぜひお願いしたい。","source_cn":"不如说，我非常愿意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00F3047FC97FBEFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320627012:1":{"text":"君の魂も、ゴーランのように耐え難い苦痛を味わうことになるかもしれない。その痛みは魂の奥底に根付き、永遠に癒えることはないのだぞ。","source_cn":"你的灵魂可能被撕裂，和铐兰一样承受难以忍受的痛苦，那种...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE8408FCE5A5CADF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320627013:1":{"text":"でも、兄はそれに耐え続けたのでしょう？","source_cn":"这就是哥哥一直在承受的，对么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE720614B99626797","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320627014:1":{"text":"だからといって、君まで同じ目に遭う必要はない。","source_cn":"铐兰已经承受过痛苦了，你和他不一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26010F4F3665C900","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320627015:1":{"text":"なぜだ、なぜ運命はラジノフ家の……エフニルの子孫をここまで苦しめる……","source_cn":"你是拉季诺夫家的人……命运为什么一定要这样作弄叶夫尼的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03E1ADDFA2D76B25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320627016:1":{"text":"お気遣いに感謝します、子爵様。ですが、私は身勝手な願いで兄を苦しめてしまった……だから、ここで逃げるわけにはいかないのです。","source_cn":"感谢您的关怀，子爵先生。但是我已经为了自己自私的愿望而...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD69358CFBC5E38B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320627017:1":{"text":"それに、慎重でお優しいあなたなら、きっと全力で私と兄の願いを叶えてくださると信じております。","source_cn":"而且，您那么谨慎温柔，我相信您会拼尽全力实现我和哥哥的愿望。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E7F2D7AC5DED36C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1320627018:1":{"text":"どうか、兄に安らぎを与えてください。","source_cn":"——让他安息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AFE10CB12C4BD33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1320627019:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"…………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70646B5D874C111A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_